Answer:
Here are the steps to use the scissor jack safely, according to the provided information:

1. Assemble the Jack handle and wheel spanner. (nexon-2025-owners-manual.pdf, page 244, text)
2. Position the jack vertically and raise it by turning the jack handle clockwise until the jack sits completely on the specified point and the base of the jack lies evenly on the ground. (nexon-2025-owners-manual.pdf, page 244, text)
3. Lower the jack completely then tighten the wheel nuts diagonally in opposite sequence one by one using wheel spanner. (nexon-2025-owners-manual.pdf, page 245, text)

